<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTAL KRAKOW SIGNS PLN 14.3 MLN DEAL.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTAL KRAKOW SIGNS PLN 14.3 MLN DEAL.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction company Mostostal Krakow SA signed a 14.3-million-zloty contract on repair and modernisation works in steel mill Huta Sendzimira SA, Mostostal said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It did not give any further details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
